{"server":"tw","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_08_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_08","title":"願跟隨主","storyCode":"HE-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"6392067e806ce66fe475f230784e629b034d7ffe2844c63642c56ebf04ee9a50","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的花......都沒了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再往前走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此處建築結構遭到多次破壞，具有高度不穩定性......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒，回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，費德里科先生......我想......再找找看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說過的，這裡沒有你想要的花了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我就是想確認......所有的花都死了。沒有一朵......任何一朵......幸運地得救。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法解析你的行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我親手種出的花......代表友誼和希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可人們早就不再在意這些，沒有人再關注花期，他們遺忘了最不該忘記的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道不可笑嗎？竟然有人懷疑萊蒙德會放火，就因為他是薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們明明在一起生活了這麼久。越是困難的時刻，我們越該相互依偎......這是主教閣下說的話。我很想相信......我本該相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而事實就擺在我面前，我無法扭過頭去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何隔閡始終存在？人與人是不是註定無法彼此理解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一點點的混亂，就足以讓表面上的秩序走向崩塌，而一旦陷入混亂，人們就會互相傷害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了......我已經忍耐夠久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克萊芒跌跌撞撞地來到了被大火燒毀的聖像面前。\n那裡沒有第二朵幸運的花，只有一個破舊的木盤，裡面盛著幾片乾癟的麵包。\n他將那氣味有些古怪的麵包放入口中咀嚼。\n是略有些腥鹹，帶著海潮一樣苦澀的滋味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳，難吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒，把你手中的東西放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下？這可不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜，我本想去告解，結果無意中聽到主教閣下的計劃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來想，至少杰拉爾德他們不用參與進來，他們本來就要走了不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但為什麼......最後會變成這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會吃完這些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你並不是為了延續自己的生命。為何還要嘗試轉化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想求一個答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，這世上到底有沒有能救我們的存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科知道，自己現在必須要阻止眼前的這個人。\n但現實是，他站在原地沒有動。\n幾步之外，阿爾圖羅奏響了她的樂器，琴聲劃破寂靜的帷幕，其中的情感費德里科不明白，也從不試圖明白。\n只是頭一次，執行者無法掌控自己的行動。\n他開始無法理解自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"樂曲被拉高了一個音調。\n音符間彌散的沉默像是某種笑話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......這是，血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這算什麼，只是這樣而已嗎？只是，咳咳，只是這樣，算什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼吸頻率加快，剛剛的撞擊有造成下呼吸道或肺部出血的可能性，不採取措施的話可能引發窒息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要立刻接受治療。在此之前，我會先對你進行急救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，咳咳、我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克萊芒抬手捂住嘴，儘量壓低咳嗽的聲音。\n但血仍然很快溢出手掌，帶著令人不舒服的黏膩，順著指縫往下淌。\n他踉蹌著後退一步，摔倒在破損的聖像前。\n被他燒毀的聖像這時彷彿又接納了他這個失去了力氣的兇手，聖像的斷臂落在兩側，好似一個輕柔的抱擁。\n克萊芒感到一陣奇異的溫暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是什麼事都沒有嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果連這個也是假的，主教閣下他受到了欺騙，根本沒有什麼神明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你吃下的東西是出自海洋的某種殘渣，有極大機率引起生理層面上的變異，但從來都與你口中的神明無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......多可笑啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的狀態很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依照目前的速度惡化下去，你將會進入休克狀態，死亡的風險很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？那真......不錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你想要留下任何遺囑，我可以作為你的遺囑執行人為你服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺囑......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有什麼要留下的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭人......我們的樂園是虛假的，你們的信仰是虛假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"友誼、信賴、期盼、未來......什麼都沒有了，沒人能真的得救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人......沒有人能真正獲得救贖......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"這是一種選擇嗎？這是某種好的結局嗎？\n執行者站在原地，沒有再上前。\n不論如何，所有的苦痛都逐漸遠去。\n疲憊的花匠終於合上眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"餘音還在迴盪，我還能感受到......最後一刻琴弦傳導至指尖的震顫，尖銳得幾乎能割破皮膚的尾音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是最初，那旋律平靜如涓流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個原本平凡的人，用自己的生命證明了一件事——並不存在什麼拯救者。他頑強的精神戰勝了變化中的肉體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼美妙的音樂......這就是人類堅韌又自由的精神，與那些可悲的海洋生物截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這首曲子將把他的故事帶給所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們將理解他的情感，稱頌他的意志，讚美他的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒·杜波瓦將被世人銘記。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你說是不是，費德里科？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會在那裡多留一會，畢竟你好像十分在意那位死者......甚至認為他的事務優先順序高於對我的追捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你學會哀憐了嗎？還是說，你依然和過去一樣，識別不出他人的喜怒哀樂，與眾人格格不入？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通緝犯阿爾圖羅，你的源石技藝又一次引導了他人的死亡。我不可能放過射程範圍內最大的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依據拉特蘭律法，你的刑期會再次增加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求死是他的個人意志，即使沒有我的演奏，他也會走上這條路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次又一次，我只不過揭示了這些可憐人內心的瘡疤，旁人卻要扭過頭去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也和其他人一樣，被他的經歷刺痛了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你是不是至今仍然不理解無法按捺的衝動？像那位主教堅持走上一條荊棘之路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......像我不能自已地想要演奏他們的情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確不能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理解與否，並不影響律法的執行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我是為了克萊芒得到應有的處置而前往聖堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他罪不至死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想拯救一個意圖自毀的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你沒有發現嗎？這個念頭並不合乎邏輯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒說，在看似完美的事物上，傷痕一旦出現就無法挽回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會驗證這句話的正確性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你好像確實變得有趣了那麼一點點......只是一點點而已。或許等下次見面的時候，我就能彈奏出你的思緒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，我該結束這趟旅程了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大貴族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，是阿爾圖羅小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭候多時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大貴族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，明明是我們主動邀請您做客，我卻來得有些遲了，這裡非常難找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大貴族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔，我是不是來得不是時候？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這真是，看一眼就會讓人頭痛三天的畫面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你怎麼和阿爾圖羅對上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大貴族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，拉特蘭的先生們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，這位......女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（費德里科，她身上的紋章屬於某位選帝侯！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在不能直接對阿爾圖羅動手，這可能會影響拉特蘭和萊塔尼亞之間的關係......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我拒絕你的提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們商量好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如，費德里科，我給你一次機會，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想要對我舉起銃，你該瞄準的是這裡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑髮女人捧起執行者握緊銃的手。\n她讓銃口抵住自己的前額。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要扣下扳機，銃的彈丸就會貫穿我的頭顱，從此之後，我就不會再是你的困擾......費德里科，你想要這麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要試試看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要將通緝犯逮捕，非必要情況，一般不建議直接擊斃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的說辭很合理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真動手？！都和你說了會是國際問題了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，奧倫，好像事情沒那麼嚴重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她不會有事。你不瞭解這個女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，只是玩一個小遊戲罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大貴族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅小姐，這是某種源石技藝的應用效果嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大貴族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，剛剛的舉動也太過危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您的關心，如果還有下一次，我會注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，就當作我給你留下的線索吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有想過，演奏從未停止，只是你聽不見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是不到最精彩最宏大的段落時，所有人都聽不見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，樂聲已盡，我也該再次出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的諸位，下次再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“大貴族使者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們先失陪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然真的就這麼站著，放人走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為至少得要我和里凱萊兩個人一起上，才能把你攔下來呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很吵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？哎，費德里科，你去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他往鐘塔外圍走了，我記得那邊應該是......這裡的墓地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，別看了，沒出什麼事就好。我們也還有事要做呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科哥哥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅姐姐......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不在呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我們再去其他地方找！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，怎麼有一個叔叔躺在這裡呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，這個叔叔睡著啦，我們不要吵醒他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識這個叔叔耶，他會種好漂亮的花，就是媽媽經常帶回家，插在瓶子裡的那種！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩拉，你幹嘛呀，那個是媽媽給我們的欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，叔叔在這裡睡覺，會著涼的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽說，好孩子要學會感、感際。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是感激啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那就暫時借給叔叔好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，希望叔叔睡醒之後，能繼續種出好多好多好看的花......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定可以的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
